{
    "title": "Feelsy: Stress Anxiety Relief",
    "description": "<strong>\ud83e\uddd8Feelsy is your direct way to relieve anxiety and reduce stress.\ud83e\uddd8</strong>\r\n\r\nIf you're looking for a way to get <strong>anxiety relief</strong>, you've just found the perfect option for <strong>antistress</strong>! Our relaxing app offers different games to help you unwind, including relaxing textures and sounds. Whether you need to de-stress with our app for sleep or just want to play a free game to take your mind off things, our antistress app has got you covered.\r\n\r\nReward your senses and enjoy <strong>soothe textures</strong> that will <strong>reduce stress</strong>, anxiety and help you sleep better. \r\n\r\n\r\n<strong>\ud83d\udc86Clear your mind with slime simulator, fluid mechanics and relaxing games.</strong>\r\n\r\nFeelsy features a variety of soothing ASMR sounds and visual triggers that will have you experiencing relaxation and pleasant tingling as you listen and watch. \r\n\r\nIt will help you have <strong>stress relief</strong> and relax after a tiring day, fall asleep faster, or just beat boredom by playing with beautiful and soothing textures and patterns.\r\n\r\n<strong>How it works:</strong>\r\n\ud83d\ude0d Choose a <strong>fluid, slime texture</strong> or other effect you like.\r\n\ud83c\udfa7 Put on your headphones for a <strong>relaxing effect</strong>.\r\n\ud83d\udc46 Start using the screen. You can touch, slap, stretch, and slide.\r\n\r\nFeelsy can help in different stressful situations such as flying, moving, before important events in life or just to calm the mind for better sleep. \r\n\r\n<strong>What do you get?</strong>\r\n\ud83d\ude0c Keep your mind calm.\r\n\ud83d\udcad Less negative thoughts in your head.\r\n\ud83e\uddd8 Become more self-confident\r\n\r\n<strong>Features:</strong>\r\n- Realistic simulation: Squeeze, stretch, knead - just like in real life!\r\n- Different types of textures and particles.\r\n- Pleasant  <strong>ASMR</strong> sounds: Turn up the volume and enjoy!\r\n- Satisfying mechanics: more <strong>fluid</strong> and <strong>soothe</strong>. \r\n- Train your brain to be more resistant to stress!\r\n\r\n<u>Get anti stress and enjoy the current moments.</u>\r\n<u><strong>Relax your mind and sleep without anxiety every day!</strong></u>\r\n\r\nDo you want contact with us? \r\n\ud83d\udce7Send email to our Support Team feelsy@appdesk.zendesk.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "<strong>\ud83e\uddd8Feelsy is your direct way to relieve anxiety and reduce stress.\ud83e\uddd8</strong><br><br>If you&#39;re looking for a way to get <strong>anxiety relief</strong>, you&#39;ve just found the perfect option for <strong>antistress</strong>! Our relaxing app offers different games to help you unwind, including relaxing textures and sounds. Whether you need to de-stress with our app for sleep or just want to play a free game to take your mind off things, our antistress app has got you covered.<br><br>Reward your senses and enjoy <strong>soothe textures</strong> that will <strong>reduce stress</strong>, anxiety and help you sleep better. <br><br><br><strong>\ud83d\udc86Clear your mind with slime simulator, fluid mechanics and relaxing games.</strong><br><br>Feelsy features a variety of soothing ASMR sounds and visual triggers that will have you experiencing relaxation and pleasant tingling as you listen and watch. <br><br>It will help you have <strong>stress relief</strong> and relax after a tiring day, fall asleep faster, or just beat boredom by playing with beautiful and soothing textures and patterns.<br><br><strong>How it works:</strong><br>\ud83d\ude0d Choose a <strong>fluid, slime texture</strong> or other effect you like.<br>\ud83c\udfa7 Put on your headphones for a <strong>relaxing effect</strong>.<br>\ud83d\udc46 Start using the screen. You can touch, slap, stretch, and slide.<br><br>Feelsy can help in different stressful situations such as flying, moving, before important events in life or just to calm the mind for better sleep. <br><br><strong>What do you get?</strong><br>\ud83d\ude0c Keep your mind calm.<br>\ud83d\udcad Less negative thoughts in your head.<br>\ud83e\uddd8 Become more self-confident<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>- Realistic simulation: Squeeze, stretch, knead - just like in real life!<br>- Different types of textures and particles.<br>- Pleasant  <strong>ASMR</strong> sounds: Turn up the volume and enjoy!<br>- Satisfying mechanics: more <strong>fluid</strong> and <strong>soothe</strong>. <br>- Train your brain to be more resistant to stress!<br><br><u>Get anti stress and enjoy the current moments.</u><br><u><strong>Relax your mind and sleep without anxiety every day!</strong></u><br><br>Do you want contact with us? <br>\ud83d\udce7Send email to our Support Team feelsy@appdesk.zendesk.com",
